   "say": [
    {
     "at": 0.5,
     "text": "Step 1. The parts. The display board is a Waveshare R P 23 50 touch L-C-D 2.8. It brings the charger for one lithium polymer cell."
    },
    {
     "at": 11.03,
     "text": "Behind it: one cell of 1000 milliamp hours with a 1.25 millimetre plug, a 5 volt boost board with an enable pad, and an I-N-A 2 19 current sensor board."
    },
    {
     "at": 23.19,
     "text": "Also needed: two male servo connectors, with pins as on a receiver, the 12 pin and the 4 pin lead that come with the display board, a 10 kilo ohm resistor, a 5.6 volt zener diode of 2 to 5 watts, a 470 micro farad capacitor, double sided tape, and four M 2.5 screws."
    }
   ],
